  "ruleSetPolicy": "",
  "description": "The Automatic Ticket Prioritization System classifies and ranks support tickets based on urgency, impact, and customer type. This ensures that critical issues receive immediate attention while lower-priority tickets are handled efficiently.\n\nThe system evaluates three critical factors:\n\nIssue Severity – Defines how serious the issue is (e.g., system down, minor bug, general inquiry).\nAffected Users – Determines how many users are impacted (single user, department, or entire company).\nCustomer Type – Prioritizes based on SLA agreements (VIP customer, regular customer, internal employee).\n\nThe prioritization levels include High Priority, Medium Priority, and Low Priority.",
